<mjml lang="en" dir="ltr">
	<mj-head>
		<mj-title>Meet Matterport's 3D Model for Build Projects</mj-title>
		<mj-preview>Bring your site, data and teams onto one platform.</mj-preview>
		<mj-attributes>
		<mj-all padding="0" />
		<mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF" />
		</mj-attributes>

		<mj-raw>
			<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark" />
			<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="dark" />
		</mj-raw>
        
        <mj-font name="Roboto" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto" />

		<mj-style>
            * { -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased !important; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale !important; } 
            a[x-apple-data-detectors], p, li { text-decoration: none !important; font-size: inherit !important; font-family: inherit !important; font-weight: inherit !important; line-height: inherit !important; } 
            body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #000000 !important; }
            [data-ogsc] .body-wrapper, [data-ogsb] .body-wrapper { background-color: #000000 !important; }
            .body-wrapper { background-image: linear-gradient(#000000, #000000) !important; }
            .ReadMsgBody { width: 100%; } 
            .ExternalClass { width: 100%; }
            .ExternalClass, .ExternalClass p, .ExternalClass span, .ExternalClass font, .ExternalClass td, .ExternalClass div { line-height: 100%; }
            a.MsoHyperlink, span.MsoHyperlink { mso-style-priority:99; color: inherit; }
            a.MsoHyperlinkFollowed, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed { mso-style-priority: 99; color: inherit; }
            p, td, div { mso-line-height-rule: exactly; }
            u + .body-wrapper a { color: inherit; text-decoration: none; font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit; font-weight: inherit; line-height: inherit; }
            .a6S { display: none !important; opacity: 0.01 !important; }
            img.g-img + div { display: none !important; }
            .im { color: inherit !important; }
            a[x-apple-data-detectors] { color: inherit !important; text-decoration: none !important; font-size: inherit !important; font-family: inherit !important; font-weight: inherit !important; line-height: inherit !important; }
        </mj-style>
		
	</mj-head>
    
	<mj-body css-class="body-wrapper" background-color="#000000">

		<mj-section>
			<mj-column>
				<mj-image src="img/img-logo-138x28.png" alt="Matterport Logo" width="138px" align="left" padding="23px 23px 23px 22px" />
			</mj-column>
		</mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column>
                <mj-image src="img/img-hero-600x318.jpg" alt="Beyond the Scans header image" width="600px" align="center" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="50px 23px 0 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    Hi [First Name],
                </mj-text>
                <mj-spacer height="25px" />
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    82% of Australian construction firms have seen little&#8209;to&#8209;no productivity gains in the last five years*. Hard work alone isn't the problem &mdash; when teams are switching between tools, chasing updates, and working from data that doesn't reflect what's on site, progress stalls.
                </mj-text>
                <mj-spacer height="25px" />
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    That's where Matterport comes in.
                </mj-text>
                <mj-spacer height="25px" />
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    With our AI&#8209;powered 3D model, your site, data and teams can all be brought into one connected view, so everyone is working from a single source of truth.
                </mj-text>
                <mj-spacer height="25px" />
                <mj-button font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" background-color="#FF3158" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="12px" line-height="12px" font-weight="bold" padding="0" inner-padding="11px 22px 11px 22px" align="left" border-radius="50px" href="https://www.beyondthelens.matterport.com/au/contact" target="_blank">
                    Book a free demo
                </mj-button>
                
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>
       
        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="50px 23px 60px 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" color="#FF3158" font-size="24px" font-weight="bold" line-height="31px" padding-bottom="12px">
                   HOW IT WORKS
                </mj-text>
                <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="solid" border-color="#FF3158" />
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold" padding-top="30px">
                    1.&nbsp;&nbsp;Capture Your Site
                </mj-text>
                <mj-image src="img/img-captureSite-554x269.png" alt="Capture your site" width="554px" align="center" padding="30px 0 30px 0" />
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    Your entire site can be captured into an accurate, measurable 3D model in hours, not days &mdash; replacing tedious photo&#8209;taking, manual measurements and slow email back&#8209;and&#8209;forth with one reliable record of site conditions.
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="0 23px 60px 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold">
                    2.&nbsp;&nbsp;Turn It Into Smart Data
                </mj-text>
                <mj-image src="img/TurnSmartData-554x269.png" alt="Turn It Into Smart Data" width="554px" align="center" padding="30px 0 30px 0" />
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    Simply export 3D site files, BIM, CAD and point&#8209;cloud data in the formats your teams already use &mdash; .E57, .XYZ, .OBJ, .RVT, .IFC, .DWG.
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="0 23px 0 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold">
                    3.&nbsp;&nbsp;Connect &amp; Collaborate
                </mj-text>
                <mj-image src="img/img-connectCollaborate-554x269.png" alt="Connect and Collaborate" width="554px" align="center" padding="30px 0 30px 0" />
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    Your project data is accessible to everyone &mdash; architects, VDC/BIM managers, site managers, project directors and subcontractors. One platform to uncover insights and drive fast decisions. One source of truth from capture to handover.
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="60px 23px 0 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" color="#FF3158" font-size="24px" font-weight="bold" line-height="31px" padding-bottom="10px">
                   WHY MATTERPORT?
                </mj-text>
                <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="solid" border-color="#FF3158" />
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold" padding="30px 0 30px 0">
                    Real results without being onsite
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-wrapper padding="0 23px 15px 23px">
            <mj-section background-color="#262626" border-left="6px #FF3158 solid" padding="20px">
                <mj-column>
                    <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" font-weight="bold"  color="#FF3158" padding-bottom="10px">
                        2,800 working days saved
                    </mj-text>
                    <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                        Sydney-based SyncTech used Matterport to turn a 10&#8209;day coordination window into hours &ndash; from site scan to full team access. Their clients now complete 30% more work in the same timeframe, with 5.5 days saved at project kick-off and up to 5&#8209;6 weeks saved on large builds. 
                    </mj-text>
                    <mj-spacer height="20px" />
                    <mj-button font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" background-color="#FF3158" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="12px" line-height="12px" font-weight="bold" padding="0" inner-padding="11px 22px 11px 22px" align="left" border-radius="50px" href="https://matterport.com/industries/case-studies/sync-technologies-accelerates-construction-projects-saving-its-customers?srsltid=AfmBOoopqSAC4qJD8x9xaQuFUNIwbZ-Hvk66-468iJ4eNwpvm54pB8fI" target="_blank">
                        Read more
                    </mj-button>
                </mj-column>
            </mj-section>
        </mj-wrapper>

        <mj-wrapper padding="0 23px 60px 23px">
            <mj-section background-color="#262626" border-left="6px #FF3158 solid" padding="20px">
                <mj-column>
                    <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" font-weight="bold"  color="#FF3158" padding-bottom="10px">
                        60&ndash;70% faster on-site capture
                    </mj-text>
                    <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                        Acciona adopted Matterport for Melbourne's major rail infrastructure upgrade, where every hour of downtime carried cost and risk. On&#8209;site capture time became 60&ndash;70% faster than traditional methods, turning what used to be an impossible task into routine daily capture &ndash; even under a 60&#8209;day possession window.
                    </mj-text>
                    <mj-spacer height="20px" />
                    <mj-button font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" background-color="#FF3158" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="12px" line-height="12px" font-weight="bold" padding="0" inner-padding="11px 22px 11px 22px" align="left" border-radius="50px" href="https://matterport.com/industries/case-studies/acciona-transformed-rail-infrastructure-delivery-with-digital-twins-and-reality-capture" target="_blank">
                        Read more
                    </mj-button>
                </mj-column>
            </mj-section>
        </mj-wrapper>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="0 23px 60px 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold">
                    Protect your business from damage claims before you start building
                </mj-text>
                <mj-image src="img/img-protectBusiness-554x269.png" alt="Protect your business from damage claims before you start building" width="554px" align="center" padding="20px 0 20px 0" />
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    Matterport speeds up critical dilapidation reporting from days to hours, with a single navigable spatial asset that captures complete site conditions of affected buildings &ndash; eliminating manual photo captures and debates over undocumented defects. Protect your business and mitigate hefty legal claims with a defensible record of pre-construction or as-built conditions throughout your project lifecycle.
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="0 23px 60px 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold">
                    Catch issues before they start to cost you
                </mj-text>
                <mj-image src="img/img-catchIssues-554x269.png" alt="Catch issues before they start to cost you" width="554px" align="center" padding="20px 0 20px 0" />
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    Rework absorbs 9% of project cost industry&#8209;wide, and for Build Health International, 52% of that came down to poor data and miscommunication &ndash; teams acting on different information until something went wrong on site. With virtual site access at every stage of the build, teams can inspect, measure and verify conditions remotely before small issues become costly problems.
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="0 23px 0 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold">
                    Now Available &ndash; The complete field kit for enterprise&#8209;grade capture
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

         <mj-section>
            <mj-column>
                <mj-image src="img/img-fieldKit-600x385.jpg" alt="The complete field kit for enterprise-grade capture" width="600px" align="center" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="0 23px 50px 23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif" font-size="15px" line-height="20px" color="#FFFFFF">
                    Matterport speeds up critical dilapidation reporting from days to hours, with a single navigable spatial asset that captures complete site conditions of affected buildings &ndash; eliminating manual photo captures and debates over undocumented defects. Protect your business and mitigate hefty legal claims with a defensible record of pre&#8209;construction or as&#8209;built conditions throughout your project lifecycle.
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section padding="0 23px 30px 23px">
            <mj-column width="48%" background-color="#FF3158" border-radius="14px" padding="20px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" font-weight="bold" align="center" color="#2B2A2A">
                    Performance Kit<br />
                <span style="color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold;">AU $7,500</span>
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
            <mj-column width="4%">
                <mj-spacer height="20px" />
            </mj-column>
            <mj-column width="48%" background-color="#2B2A2A" border-radius="14px" padding="20px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="18px" line-height="23px" font-weight="bold" align="center" color="#FF3158">
                    <span style="white-space: nowrap;">Pro3 Camera<br />
                    <span style="color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: bold;">AU $6,500</span></span>
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="0 23px 20px 23px">
                <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="solid" border-color="#FF3158" />
                    <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="22px" line-height="29px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold" align="center" padding-top="40px">
                        See how Matterport can work for your projects
                    </mj-text>
                    <mj-button font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" background-color="#FF3158" color="#FFFFFF" font-size="12px" line-height="12px" font-weight="bold" padding="30px 0 40px 0" inner-padding="11px 22px 11px 22px" align="center" border-radius="50px" href="https://www.beyondthelens.matterport.com/au/contact" target="_blank">
                    Book a free demo
                </mj-button>
                <mj-divider border-width="1px" border-style="solid" border-color="#FF3158" align="center" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column>
                <mj-image src="img/img-footer-600x200.jpg" alt="Footer" width="600px" />
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

        <mj-section>
            <mj-column padding="23px">
                <mj-text font-family="Roboto, Arial, sans-serif" font-size="10px" line-height="16px" color="#FFFFFF" font-weight="bold" align="center">
                    <a href="{{unsubscribe}}" style="color: #FFFFFF; text-decoration: underline;" target="_blank">Unsubscribe</a>
                </mj-text>
            </mj-column>
        </mj-section>

    </mj-body>
</mjml>